# WET PAINT: park in the bottom-right corner of course 1 and leave the foes
# to it. Before the clock runs out they have the floor 80% pink, and the
# results screen has a message for you. No cheats past the start: real
# garages, real foes, the whole clock.
seed 1
game wetpaint
wait 5
cheat course 1
cheat go
cheat car 25 12 0
wait 5
expect stopped == 1
expect secret == 0
waituntil secret == 1 2700
expect time > 0
waituntil state == 4 2700
expect res_secret == 1
expect res_pass == 0
# anywhere else, nothing
cheat course 1
cheat go
cheat nogarages
cheat car 0 0 3
cheat fill 2 190
wait 2
expect secret == 0
